SUMMARY:Information: Tottenham Hale Station: Tottenham Hotspur vs Aston 
 Villa match at Tottenham Hotspur Stadium on Saturday 19 September (1230 
 start): Tottenham Hale station is expected to be extremely busy between 
 1030 and 1200 and between 1430 and 1600. You may find it easier to use 
 Northumberland Park station where additional Greater Anglia and Stansted 
 Express trains will call before and after the match\, please board one of 
 the front 7 coaches for Northumberland Park. Please note that there is no 
 down escalator to the Victoria line at present\, so queuing times are 
 expected to increase.
END:VEVENT
